	 * This value should be one of <code>SWT.BORDER_SOLID</code>,
	 * <code>SWT.BORDER_DASH</code>,<code>SWT.BORDER_DOT</code> or
	 * <code>SWT.NONE</code>.
	 * </p>
	 * 
	 * @see SWT#BORDER_SOLID
	 * @see SWT#BORDER_DASH 
